into tiles_libm.he
lang he
use std

A regression test of the libm tile against Rust's wasm32 libm. `SAMPLES` lists triples: a function code (0 sin, 1 cos, 2 tan, 3 asin, 4 acos, 5 atan, 6 log2, 7 log10, 8 atan2 of (x, y) meaning `libm::atan2(x, y)`, 9 `libm::hypot(x, y)`, 10 `libm::pow(x, y)`), then the bit patterns of x and y as unsigned ints.

```he
use tiles.libm
use binary
```

